   "notes": "Besson et al. give the 300 K D2O ice-VIII molar V0=12.45 cm^3/mol, converted here to the Z=8 tetragonal cell. Their BM3 fit gives K0=20.4 GPa and K0'=4.7 for 0-10 GPa. They state that no pressure/volume error can be quoted because the result depends on the adopted 300 K EOS, and that it must not be used above 10 GPa.",
